<%# ============================================================
    FILE: app/views/pages/_process.html.erb
    PURPOSE: Process — the four steps of a project, in order.
    ============================================================ %>

<section id="process" class="st-block">
  <div class="st-wrap">
    <div class="st-sec-head">
      <h2>How a project runs</h2>
      <p>Weekly demos from the first week. Decisions are written down as we go.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="st-steps">
      <li class="st-step"><div class="st-step-n">Step 1</div><h3>Scope</h3><p>Constraints, success criteria and deliverables, agreed in a short kickoff.</p></li>
      <li class="st-step"><div class="st-step-n">Step 2</div><h3>Build</h3><p>Fast iterations across hardware and software, with a demo every week.</p></li>
      <li class="st-step"><div class="st-step-n">Step 3</div><h3>Test</h3><p>In real conditions: power, sensing quality, failure modes, not only on the bench.</p></li>
      <li class="st-step"><div class="st-step-n">Step 4</div><h3>Handover</h3><p>Working demo, documentation and a roadmap to pilot or production.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
